            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A blade outer air seal (106) includes a base portion (124) that extends between a first circumferential side (C1) and a second circumferential side (C2) and from a first axial side (A1) to a second axial side (A2). A first wall (120) is axially spaced from a second wall (122). The first (120) and second (122) walls extend from the base portion (124) to an outer wall (126). A rib (130) extends from the base portion (124) to the outer wall (126) and spaced axially between the first (120) and second walls (122).</p>
            </abstract>
